#. translators: %s: link to WooCommerce Settings > Advanced > Features
#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:148
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your Checkout page uses the WooCommerce block-based checkout, and your "
"WooCommerce version is too old for this plugin's block checkout support. "
"Update WooCommerce to 8.9+, or enable \"Cart and checkout shortcodes\" under "
"%s."
msgstr ""
"Ihre Checkout-Seite verwendet den blockbasierten WooCommerce-Checkout, Ihre "
"WooCommerce-Version ist jedoch zu alt für die Block-Checkout-Unterstützung "
"dieses Plugins. Aktualisieren Sie WooCommerce auf 8.9 oder höher, oder "
"aktivieren Sie \"Cart and checkout shortcodes\" unter %s."

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:157
msgid ""
"Your Checkout page uses the WooCommerce block-based checkout. Customers will "
"see Province/City and Ward/Commune fields for the current (post 1/7/2025) "
"address structure. The legacy structure with District is only available on "
"the Classic Checkout."
msgstr ""
"Ihre Checkout-Seite verwendet den blockbasierten WooCommerce-Checkout. "
"Kunden sehen die Felder Provinz/Stadt und Gemeinde/Bezirk für die aktuelle "
"Adressstruktur (nach dem 1.7.2025). Die alte Struktur mit Bezirk ist nur im "
"klassischen Checkout verfügbar."

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:171
msgid "Address Settings"
msgstr "Adresseinstellungen"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:176
msgid "Default Address Structure"
msgstr "Standard-Adressstruktur"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:181
msgid "New structure (After 1/7/2025) - 34 provinces"
msgstr "Neue Struktur (nach dem 1.7.2025) - 34 Provinzen"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:184
msgid "Old structure (Before 1/7/2025) - 63 provinces"
msgstr "Alte Struktur (vor dem 1.7.2025) - 63 Provinzen"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:188
msgid ""
"Choose the default address structure for the checkout form. Customers can "
"change it when placing an order."
msgstr ""
"Wählen Sie die Standard-Adressstruktur für das Checkout-Formular. Kunden "
"können sie bei der Bestellung ändern."

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:195
msgid "Central Data Server URL"
msgstr "URL des zentralen Datenservers"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:212
msgid ""
"Optional. Point this at your own address data server to keep address data "
"centrally updated across all your stores. Leave blank to use the data "
"bundled with the plugin - checkout keeps working either way; this is only "
"tried as an enhancement and the plugin falls back to its bundled data "
"automatically if the server is unreachable."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:220
msgid "Address Conversion Tool"
msgstr "Adressumwandlungstool"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:225
msgid "Enable Conversion"
msgstr "Umwandlung aktivieren"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:234
msgid "Enable converting addresses from the old structure to the new structure"
msgstr "Umwandlung von Adressen von der alten in die neue Struktur aktivieren"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:237
msgid ""
"Converts existing orders from the old address structure to the new structure "
"using the bundled conversion table. Most wards convert automatically; a "
"small number that were split between multiple new wards during the merger "
"are flagged for manual review instead of being guessed."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:244
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen speichern"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:249
msgid "Convert Existing Orders"
msgstr "Bestehende Bestellungen umwandeln"

#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:250
msgid ""
"Convert addresses in existing orders from the old structure to the new "
"structure."
msgstr ""
"Wandelt Adressen in bestehenden Bestellungen von der alten in die neue "
"Struktur um."

